You can determine whether a screen reader is currently active by using the `AccessibilityInfo` API [1][2]. Specifically, you can call the `isScreenReaderEnabled()` method, which returns a promise that resolves to a boolean (`true` when a screen reader is enabled and `false` otherwise) [2][3].

