RTL support is enabled by default in SDK 58 and later [2]. To explicitly configure it using the `expo-localization` config plugin, set the `supportsRTL` option in your `app.json`:

```json app.json
{
  "expo": {
    "plugins": [
      [
        "expo-localization",
        {
          "supportsRTL": true,
          "forcesRTL": false,
          "supportedLocales": ["en", "ja"]
        }
      ]
    ]
  }
}
```

To opt out of RTL layout, set `supportsRTL` to `false` [2]. To force RTL layout for testing or apps localized only for RTL locales, set `forcesRTL` to `true` [2][3].

